  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The Imposter generation feature on the VRChat website is currently not functioning. The process starts but consistently ends with an error message.\n\nSteps to Reproduce:\n\n1. Go to https://vrchat.com/home/avatars and open the details page of an avatar that does not have an Imposter.\n\n2.Click the \"Generate Imposters\" button at the bottom of the page.\n\n3. The button text changes to \"Generating Imposters\" as expected.\n\n4. After a few seconds, a system message appears: \"System Message - Oh no! We tried, but we could not generate an impostor version of the avatar [Avatar Name].\"\n\n5. Even after waiting, no Imposter is generated.\n\nAdditional Context:\n\n・I successfully generated an Imposter on April 4th without any issues, suggesting this is a recent regression.\n\n・Similar issues have been reported by another user on X (formerly Twitter).",
